      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so basically it's about whether i'm working on the real data or just some temporary copy. is there any way to tell for sure if pandas is giving me a view or a copy in a specific instance? i'm worried about accidentally messing up my main dataset if the warning doesn't pop up next time.",
